# What a built-in that is written as the callee gives is judged by its rows and by what is written of the arguments, whoever calls: each function is called once, with a number for which the walk folds the call to an int32
# REPORTED ALL THE SAME: root: a square root has a fraction . square: a power leaves the range . size: the size of the least int32 is no int32 . parsed: a text may hold no number . number: Number() of an int32 is written to give a number
# NOT REPORTED: floor . least . sign . whole . bits . product: the rows say that an int32 comes of an int32
